From cd3f70d58445bd53a23f65cb7d833c72eeb25257 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sam (local build)" <sam@local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:27:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] tests: v1c dynamic frames - run 5 bytes/minislots, run
 1/2 replays, unsure cases

- test_dde_emu_core: builder vs every real DDE 0xE6/0xE8/0xFB of run 5
  (E2E key 273/273, counters, steady-state content, cycle classes), DTS for
  4/6/8 bytes, 14-byte packing, tracker unit cases, tracker vs the whole
  run 5 bus (63400 predictions, never later than the real frame)
- test_dde_emu_replay: dyn-run1 / dyn-run2 (grid, order, overlap, bytes,
  counters, periods, pre-ign statics), dyn-unsure (unexplained frame start,
  unknown length, missing anchor: skipped in exactly those cycles),
  dyn-run5 (same minislot as the real DDE); v1b scenarios on both the v1c
  build and the build with all dynamic frames off
- extract_replay.py: FR1/FR2 channel choice, real DDE dynamic frames out,
  ts_hw column; extract_dyn.py: dynamic vectors (dde_dyn_run5.txt)
- lateecho found that a dynamic slot could be armed for a time already
  passed (late header); fixed in the v1c commit (skipped, not a late)
---
